[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13565.03, "timestamp": "03:46:05", "text": "好的，索尼克"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13571.15, "timestamp": "03:46:11", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13574.87, "timestamp": "03:46:14", "text": "邊境。我很慶幸沒花錢買那款遊戲。另外，我還卸載了那個狩獵遊戲。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13576.51, "timestamp": "03:46:16", "text": "不太喜歡它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13579.99, "timestamp": "03:46:19", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13584.71, "timestamp": "03:46:24", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13586.55, "timestamp": "03:46:26", "text": "覺得音樂對一個人來說有點痛苦，因為它讓人感到壓抑。  我的遊戲內容都受到了限制，因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13591.07, "timestamp": "03:46:31", "text": "我的電腦有"}]